Cell["Moving on to BDFL5", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9887831242429256`*^9, 
  3.9887831286854305`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"db4cd72a-1883-e645-bd54-\
7aa7737895bc"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Since BDF2OPT(6) doesn\[CloseCurlyQuote]t exist, we will make our own linear \
combination:
BDF2OPT(6)= \[Xi] BDF5 + \[Gamma] BDF4 + \[Beta] BDF3 + (1 - \[Beta] - \
\[Gamma] - \[Xi]) BDF2
From the coefficients of BDFL5, we will solve for {\[Beta],\[Gamma],\[Xi]} \
(fixed step)\
\>", "Subsubsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9887831467328205`*^9, 3.988783170107746*^9}, {
  3.988783245476778*^9, 3.98878334245055*^9}, {3.988783595841856*^9, 
  3.988783611021105*^9}, {3.9887842648699684`*^9, 
  3.988784268321764*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a1b98312-74f0-fd47-8fd5-\
eb8a6d9a9cf6"],

